    "%@ Es mucha memoria: cierra agentes que no uses para no quedarte sin RAM." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ That’s a lot of memory: close agents you aren’t using so you don’t run out of RAM."
